{
  "bodyHash": "d2692c434e189a64",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC7sSiQ.png\" width=\"408\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>Delightful</strong> 是 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 的擴充模組，提供沉浸式、相容性優先的內容。所有新功能皆可自訂設定。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" alt=\"S&#x27;more\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>食物：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;棉花糖串</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;烤棉花糖串</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;S'more</strong>（建議搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>&nbsp;或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>&nbsp;巧克力）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinigang.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Sinigang</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;起司漢堡</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deluxe_cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;豪華起司漢堡</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;果醬罐</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/glow_jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;發光果醬罐</strong>（發光效果）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_bottle.png\" alt=\"Nut Butter Bottle\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;堅果醬瓶</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_and_jelly_sandwich.png\" alt=\"Nut Butter and Jelly Sandwich\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;堅果醬果醬三明治</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ender_nectar.png\" alt=\"Ender Nectar\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;終界甘霖</strong>（一次性使用終界箱存取）<strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_flesh.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>仙人掌肉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_steak.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;仙人掌排</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;田野沙拉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/acorn.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;橡子</strong>（從橡木葉掉落的堅果）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rock_candy.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;冰糖</strong>（用於「forge:gems/rose_quartz」，建議搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/raw_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>生山羊肉</strong>（從山羊掉落）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>熟山羊肉</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;生鹿肉排</strong>（用於「forge:raw_venison」，建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>熟鹿肉排</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cantaloupe_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;甜瓜片</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/InventivetalentDev/minecraft-assets/1.19.2/assets/minecraft/textures/item/pumpkin_pie.png\">&nbsp;南瓜派全面改動</strong>（可自訂設定）：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/pumpkin_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;您現在可以在世界中放置原版南瓜派，就像 Farmer's Delight 的派一樣！</p>\n<p>切開派即可獲得 <strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/pumpkin_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;南瓜派切片</strong>，或直接右鍵點擊食用。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>刀具</strong><strong>：</strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><em>刀具必須在「config/delightful-common.toml」設定檔中啟用。</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 銅刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bone_knife.png\" alt=\"骨刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;骨刀</strong>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bone Equipment</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\" alt=\"紫水晶刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;紫水晶刀</strong>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amethyst Equipment</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/emerald_knife.png\" alt=\"綠寶石刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;綠寶石刀</strong>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-emerald-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Emerald Equipment</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>相容性刀具</strong>&nbsp;（標籤<strong>）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/tin_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong> 錫刀</strong> (forge:ingots/tin)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鋼刀</strong> (forge:ingots/steel)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bronze_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;青銅刀</strong> (forge:ingots/bronze)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/silver_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;銀刀</strong> (forge:ingots/silver)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/brass_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黃銅刀</strong> (forge:ingots/brass)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;終界合金刀&nbsp;</strong>(forge:ingots/enderite)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/black_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑蛋白石刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:gems/black_opal)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/constantan_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;康斯坦汀刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/constantan)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/electrum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;琥珀金刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/electrum)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/invar_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;殷鋼刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/invar)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lead_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鉛刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/lead)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nickel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鎳刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/nickel)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zinc_knife.png\" alt=\"鋅刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鋅刀</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/zinc)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a>&nbsp;及擴充套件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyroot_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>天木刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/holystone_knife.png\">&nbsp;淨石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zanite_knife.png\">&nbsp;閃耀石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gravitite_knife.png\">&nbsp;引力石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyjade_knife.png\">&nbsp;空玉刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stratus_knife.png\">&nbsp;層雲石刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>維里迪烏姆石刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/infused_veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>灌注維里迪烏姆石刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux</a></strong>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/fiery_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;熾焰刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ironwood_knife.png\">&nbsp;鐵木刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/knightmetal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;騎士金屬刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steeleaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鋼鐵葉刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cloggrum_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"泥炭刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;泥炭刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/forgotten_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"遺忘之木刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;遺忘之木刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/froststeel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"霜鋼刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;霜鋼刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/utherium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"聖盾金刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;聖盾金刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Tools</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/osmium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鋨刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lapis_lazuli_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;青金石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_glowstone_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;提純螢光石刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_obsidian_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;提純黑曜石刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a>&nbsp;及&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">MythicBotany</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/elementium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"元素金刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;元素金刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/manasteel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"人礦鋼刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;人礦鋼刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/terra_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"大地之刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;大地之刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/alf_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"精靈刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;精靈刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">MythicBotany</a></strong>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden and Arcanus</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 神金刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/reinforced_deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;強化神金刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/draco_arcanus_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;龍術金刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Stuff &amp; Additions</a><strong>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_quartz_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a><strong> 鍍金石英刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/experience_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;經驗刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blazing_knife.png\" alt=\"燃燒刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a>燃燒刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleOres</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;艾德曼合金刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/mythril_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;秘銀刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/onyx_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑瑪瑙刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/thyrium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;泰里姆刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinisite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;錫尼石刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rose_gold_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"玫瑰金刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;玫瑰金刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_netherite_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"鍍金下界合金刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鍍金下界合金刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasm\" rel=\"nofollow\">End's Phantasm</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crystalline_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;水晶刀</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stellium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;星際合金刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ores-above-diamonds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ores Above Diamonds</a>：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\">&nbsp;紫水晶刀</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/netherite_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;下界合金蛋白石刀</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>獨佔刀具：</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;亞達曼特刀</strong>（用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightend</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/living_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;活體刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roots-classic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roots Classic</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/warden_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;監守者刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">）</a></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/obsidian_infused_enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑曜石灌注終界合金刀</strong>（用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">LieOnLion 的終界合金</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tgwrFK3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 靈魂鋼刀</strong>&nbsp;（用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spirit</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/necronium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"死靈金刀\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 死靈金刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasmic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phantasmic</a>）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/allthemodium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;全界金刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a></strong>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/leaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 葉片刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seeds</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/kiwano_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> 火參果刀</strong>（用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Exoticism</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>鮭莓</strong><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鮭莓</strong>是一種美味的新型漿果，會在森林中生成。它們適合作為隨身零食，也可用於需要漿果的食譜，例如&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;莓果抹茶拿鐵</strong>。</p>\n<p>它們是&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>鮭莓派</strong>（可切成&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鮭莓派切片）和&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>鮭莓冰淇淋</strong>（建議搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>）的特殊材料。</p>\n<p>這些漿果可製作成&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pips.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>鮭莓籽</strong>並種植（靈感來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berry Good</a>）。</p>\n<p>不過，<strong>鮭莓叢</strong>需要<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">雨水和光照</span>才能快速生長。</p>\n<p>該<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/salmonberry_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;鮭莓袋</strong>是用來儲存和裝飾你漿果的方塊（靈感來自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a>）。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>抹茶</strong><strong>:</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_tea_leaf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;綠茶葉</strong>&nbsp;可以透過對樹葉方塊使用刀具隨機獲得。來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Respite</a>&nbsp;的綠茶葉具有相容性且推薦使用。</p>\n<p>將它們放入鍋中烹煮，即可製成 <strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶</strong>，一種濃縮茶粉。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>接著可用於製作兩款具有效果的美味拿鐵：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶拿鐵</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;莓果抹茶拿鐵</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;抹茶冰淇淋</strong>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;油脂與油類：</span><br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>動物油脂</strong>會由任何「多脂」動物（標記為「delightful:fatty_animals」）有機率掉落，目前已包含部分模組相容支援。</p>\n<p>油脂可放入鍋中熬製成 <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_oil_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>動物油瓶</strong>，作為熔爐燃料使用，並擁有特殊能力：只要潛行右鍵點擊，即可瞬間為熔爐補充燃料。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span>&nbsp;方塊：<br></strong></span></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/acorn_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;橡子袋</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eVJANTM.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;小西瓜</strong>（在平原生成）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/cantaloupe_side_small.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;甜瓜</strong>&nbsp;（在海灘生成）</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/quartz_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;石英櫃</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;玄武岩櫃</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/246/22/637155296232619409.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>：</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/blueberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/green_apple_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie.png\">&nbsp;派系大改（Pie Overhaul）</strong>（停用任何派切片物品即可關閉）：</p>\n<p>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pie Overhaul</a>&nbsp;材質包）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/blueberry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/green_apple_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/nightshade_berry_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/crimson_berry_pie_top.png\">&nbsp;現在你可以像放置 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Farmer's Delight</span>&nbsp;派一樣，在世界中放置任何 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</span> 派的方塊！</p>\n<p>切開派可獲得 <strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blueberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_apple_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;派切片</strong>，或直接右鍵點擊食用。食用後會提供與原本相同的藥水效果。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/565/915/637924211543296813.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/baileyholl/Ars-Nouveau/1.19.x/src/main/resources/assets/ars_nouveau/textures/items/source_berry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;源漿漿果派大改</strong>（停用派切片物品即可關閉）：</p>\n<p>（建議搭配 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pie Overhaul</a>&nbsp;材質包）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/source_berry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;現在你可以像放置 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Farmer's Delight</span>&nbsp;派一樣，在世界中放置 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ars Nouveau</span> 的源漿漿果派方塊！</p>\n<p>切開派可獲得 <strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/source_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;源漿漿果派切片</strong>，或直接右鍵點擊食用。食用後會提供與原本相同的藥水效果。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong><strong>：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/chopped_clover.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;切碎三葉草</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lavender_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;薰衣草茶</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/483/128/637782721029825410.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>適用於 </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a></strong><strong>：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/coconut_curry.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>椰子咖喱</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/honey_glazed_walnut.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;蜜糖核桃</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/prickly_pear_juice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;仙人掌果汁</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/azalea_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;杜鵑花茶</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
